epth texture is working.  It's the same on both Windows/Virtual Desktop and natively on the Quest 3.\n\n```glsl\nshader_type spatial;\nrender_mode unshaded, blend_mix;  \n\nuniform vec4 hand_color : source_color = vec4(0.9, 0.8, 0.7, 0.8);\nuniform sampler2D depth_texture : hint_depth_texture;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n    float depth = texture(depth_texture, SCREEN_UV).r;\n\n    if (depth > 0.0) {\n        ALBEDO = hand_color.rgb;\n        ALPHA = hand_color.a;\n    } else {\n        discard;\n    }\n}\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3039282937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3047472166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103425#issuecomment-3047472166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103425","id":3047472166,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61pLwm","user":{"login":"dudecon","id":6752170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTIxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6752170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon","html_url":"https://github.com/dudecon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dudecon/received_events","type":"User","user